    {
      "id": "opening",
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "去年十一月，霍达尔还是弗吉尼亚大学的学生球员。今年十一月，他拿到了都灵最后一张门票。",
      "spoken": 7.824,
      "picture": 8.224,
      "audio": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/opening.mp3",
      "words": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/opening.words.json",
      "request_id": "eea9d8338b369cbb6b8263e07a2408a0b267c86a4971947bd486555566fb8e52",
      "audio_sha256": "dcd8363a6cf9a47f7971afecc4e785b0db76e2c9862796ea649526e097d2f633",
      "marks_sha256": "6775d234ceaab9c164620b1ceb2eeb006fa42d67f5b6117eec8199223e3c2e93",
      "actual_phrase_cuts": [
        0.0,
        4.0094,
        8.224
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ao_intro",
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "先从澳网说起。资格赛连过三关，再赢下一场五盘大战，拿到大满贯正赛首胜。第二轮，他三盘输给门西克。",
      "spoken": 10.752,
      "picture": 11.152,
      "audio": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/ao_intro.mp3",
      "words": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/ao_intro.words.json",
      "request_id": "28f225ac023811e2d9bd4297c7ed3487346d5e4e225a8a25b3ca47e2d851a78a",
      "audio_sha256": "0481a884165392be8857ec8947e75824ddef07de64fca0010414052b0f3708c3",
      "marks_sha256": "0ccf111dfae6fd8e2985384139b0c6da8248fc523244c7f4b01a5248b6ba9056",
      "actual_phrase_cuts": [
        0.0,
        11.152
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "marrakech_intro",
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "四月的马拉喀什，两盘击败特伦杰利蒂，拿下生涯首座巡回赛冠军。这是他第一次参加巡回赛级别的红土赛事。",
      "spoken": 9.984,
      "picture": 10.384,
      "audio": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/marrakech_intro.mp3",
      "words": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/marrakech_intro.words.json",
      "request_id": "aa71b10ff84a23f6da13fe08add7efdac82e31fe508b78174dae6b3c0670f62e",
      "audio_sha256": "3b785d2027af12870e33269e0ecb752751b6b1058b02517789fb338956959b53",
      "marks_sha256": "aa1d8a91882b53aa195d301051e45184c7f583442e6b6ab699a2e1c67c0a7de2",
      "actual_phrase_cuts": [
        0.0,
        10.384
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clay",
      "segment": 5,
      "text": "随后，巴塞罗那打进4强，马德里和罗马连续打进8强。红土上的突破还没有结束。",
      "spoken": 8.328,
      "picture": 8.728,
      "audio": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/clay.mp3",
      "words": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/clay.words.json",
      "request_id": "525d276a61ded96286bcd1a571b3b48a39633ef0534adad340d379f4c6c36498",
      "audio_sha256": "a82aa7c065b2b8cd93b84a6600677e91536fc02ee2d0fdbb457263c5453b30c9",
      "marks_sha256": "3d4812e2f2576ebb2319f3c7548b5103164f61f286c27e98faca1164b86b40fc",
      "actual_phrase_cuts": [
        0.0,
        8.728
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rg_intro",
      "segment": 6,
      "text": "法网第四轮，先丢两盘，他连扳三盘逆转卡雷尼奥·布斯塔。首次闯进大满贯8强，随后三盘输给兹维列夫。",
      "spoken": 10.44,
      "picture": 10.84,
      "audio": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/rg_intro.mp3",
      "words": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/rg_intro.words.json",
      "request_id": "51a706ad98115f293394f0392b8c66789f747ac5989368e9b0e9df2a6be032d7",
      "audio_sha256": "563cfebb8ef8ff4051134f9b73dd9cb8be212c237a2da123f1cfb321e0312d74",
      "marks_sha256": "f8935fb9bb5b4ce2630dec9073a26301ec55cea093856b23ce09002596ab4ff3",
      "actual_phrase_cuts": [
        0.0,
        7.8538,
        10.84
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "wimbledon_intro",
      "segment": 8,
      "text": "温网第二轮，再赢一场五盘大战。第三轮对望月慎太郎，先赢一盘，随后连丢三盘。",
      "spoken": 8.208,
      "picture": 8.608,
      "audio": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/wimbledon_intro.mp3",
      "words": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/wimbledon_intro.words.json",
      "request_id": "5e253c136912bddf32a9cd29905e8af279102384726ecb7549827a442c8752c8",
      "audio_sha256": "3697c2725f0e96666601ac679303f948938faf1a9ef38466eb78c833cfe34bca",
      "marks_sha256": "c8a6411d698467659d570600e9feca9c9d02847904af4e452c3ca94142ac0014",
      "actual_phrase_cuts": [
        0.0,
        3.3255,
        8.608
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "washington_intro",
      "segment": 9,
      "text": "华盛顿，连续逆转穆塞蒂和塔比洛，闯进生涯首个五百赛决赛。对弗里茨，首盘抢七落败，最终收获亚军。",
      "spoken": 9.864,
      "picture": 10.264,
      "audio": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/washington_intro.mp3",
      "words": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/washington_intro.words.json",
      "request_id": "25c76ca6b4d141f4478f7051d26d77170b241f5cf1360d8e5ab65be63474e7af",
      "audio_sha256": "9c807c853aa8f607ea2c7b9dbc9e52e408676378683762ff36411fae1ec12031",
      "marks_sha256": "db1cdf76f134028890bac5a9c9664487eaa9fb0bdf0716409fbfd03d1866cd02",
      "actual_phrase_cuts": [
        0.0,
        5.5307,
        10.264
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "montreal",
      "segment": 11,
      "text": "接着，在蒙特利尔首次打进大师赛4强。但来到美网，他第一轮就三盘输给布云朝克特。",
      "spoken": 8.472,
      "picture": 8.872,
      "audio": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/montreal.mp3",
      "words": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/montreal.words.json",
      "request_id": "2bf263a4bda11b96ae974a44ce8f7eab3bdbb745dee08920b5e982a1f509e7fb",
      "audio_sha256": "e7c7bce75752a7497111aecdf3af2c83609d9f657ab98b1f0d153702e8115f90",
      "marks_sha256": "d2cd7e73215b2eb5b7ef963a2ef1f941c38d2ba91032b395dd8267e3411b9a80",
      "actual_phrase_cuts": [
        0.0,
        4.0094,
        8.872
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "shanghai_run",
      "segment": 13,
      "text": "上海，前四场全部逆转过关。半决赛两盘击败梅德韦德夫，第一次走进大师赛决赛。",
      "spoken": 7.944,
      "picture": 8.344,
      "audio": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/shanghai_run.mp3",
      "words": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/shanghai_run.words.json",
      "request_id": "edf9f73ef50d3ce64f5234bedb092e6957cf8fa59d330b92735e6dc63e67dd88",
      "audio_sha256": "c13a4fe4e9d9e7957ab3d07e25e6265a5befac351adc22970861781211ed5fca",
      "marks_sha256": "a4eba733f02ffcf9f797c80cacca1f53c838079bfbf6b0f2c50a14f6ffa073d7",
      "actual_phrase_cuts": [
        0.0,
        3.2311,
        8.344
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "shanghai_intro",
      "segment": 14,
      "text": "对福基纳，他先赢一盘，第二盘又领先一个破发。最终被逆转，距离大师赛首冠还差一步。",
      "spoken": 8.064,
      "picture": 8.464,
      "audio": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/shanghai_intro.mp3",
      "words": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/shanghai_intro.words.json",
      "request_id": "bc63c2423148b4bd2f2664196ba39bae61c30ce44a443a56e7ad3cd149d3152d",
      "audio_sha256": "6b0ed817d7721c5c274b5c0e5280be7111ad1158f702abc1ffb4915f372c18b8",
      "marks_sha256": "b2d7123ef0bee386b71d6e09982463302967b68424cf81b1f534d1f897b46375",
      "actual_phrase_cuts": [
        0.0,
        8.464
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "paris",
      "segment": 16,
      "text": "巴黎第二轮，两盘输给鲁德。出局时，他的赛季积分来到三千二百三十四分，年终资格还要等待。",
      "spoken": 9.216,
      "picture": 9.616,
      "audio": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/paris.mp3",
      "words": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/paris.words.json",
      "request_id": "351be80390b0a49c9bf87b55795d7053a92cfa4abc218aa2c3149244225516de",
      "audio_sha256": "ffc403ec570f6cd5492f9ae5daf21189149ca96d35bd4a8b40382f57a178eb10",
      "marks_sha256": "8a19fcca2594f8290e0be63410c20b2d232567c43f67d0c0bf65a5406f841d6b",
      "actual_phrase_cuts": [
        0.0,
        9.616
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "qualification",
      "segment": 17,
      "text": "十一月六日，阿尔卡拉斯在巴黎击败弗里茨，霍达尔锁定最后一席。一年前还是大学生的他，今年第一次入围年终。",
      "spoken": 9.624,
      "picture": 10.024,
      "audio": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/qualification.mp3",
      "words": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/qualification.words.json",
      "request_id": "61aa9e30d705b0d15c29e4d93f9919e11290f57f53bc72422cc2ab6a2a4e139a",
      "audio_sha256": "29b3cd4d0ed4f70d608836978e87836a0988e80b416118086884c844d466e752",
      "marks_sha256": "b293a8ce3f01a989494847d670e42110bce1a5ed7e78cd522d6a679881cdf3cf",
      "actual_phrase_cuts": [
        0.0,
        5.6722,
        10.024
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "race_table",
      "segment": 18,
      "text": "截至十一月七日，三千二百三十四分，赛季积分榜第九。辛纳已退赛，霍达尔位列本届总决赛八位正选之中。",
      "spoken": 10.032,
      "picture": 10.432,
      "audio": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/race_table.mp3",
      "words": "/dev/shm/jodar-production/frozen-voices/race_table.words.json",
